 The README mirrors the latest 5 entries — regenerate with `bun run changelog:sync`.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+## [0.12.16] - 2026-11-03
+_Windows sandbox ACL race hardening and mid-turn workflow completion reliability._
+
+### Fixed
+- **Windows sandbox private directory & ACL verification** — serialize private directory provisioning across processes with a named mutex and in-process deduplication, explicitly persist `SE_DACL_PROTECTED` and owner SID via `SetAccessControl` before `icacls` verification, roll back newly created directories on failure, skip read-only hardlink `chmod` on Windows before staging cleanup, and normalize Docker Desktop WSL2 bind-mount paths (`/run/desktop/mnt/host/<drive>/...` and `/host_mnt/<drive>/...`).
+- **Mid-turn premature stop & prose salvage** — prevent mid-task plain-text progress replies from bypassing `MAX_PARSE_BOUNCES` and prematurely terminating active tool loops or burning `doneCorrections`, grant a post-verification completion grace step when the step limit is reached immediately after passing verification, reset `doneCorrections` after passing verification or plan reconciliation, and track verification-cycle novelty so iterative edit-test-fix loops earn step-budget extensions.
+- **Subagent & live-input resilience** — allow bounded step-budget extensions for progressing subagents, bounce once on missing role-contract headers after subagent tool activity, strip terminal capability/mouse reports in live-turn input capture, and avoid misclassifying mid-turn file paths (`/path/to/file`) or dollar amounts (`$100`) as turn-aborting slash/skill commands.
 
 ## [0.12.15] - 2026-11-03
 
